(7757104, 1283573, 149964, '<td valign="top">The contrasting colours in this are lovely. I do find the flowers on the far left and right detracting from the subject.  I wonder if a tighter crop might have emphasised the main flower more? Perhaps a portrait orientation with just the core flower coming in from bottom right with background flower reaching top right?</td>', 'The contrasting colours in this are lovely. I do find the flowers on the far left and right detracting from the subject.  I wonder if a tighter crop might have emphasised the main flower more? Perhaps a portrait orientation with just the core flower coming in from bottom right with background flower reaching top right?', '2023-09-01 08:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
